  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In a Legends of Ren Zu excerpt, after Ren Zu’s group fails to find Wisdom Gu inside Qian Kun Crystal Wall and hears of Primordial Domain, Carefree Wisdom Heart shouts that she has found something. She opens both palms and says that on her right palm she found right Gu, and on her left palm wrong Gu. Great Strength True Martial calls the two Gu ordinary looking and much less presentable than his authority Gu. Carefree Wisdom Heart answers that the two allow them to differentiate and classify knowledge, noting that much knowledge is right at one moment or place and wrong at another, and that knowledge that is always right might make a text path into Primordial Domain. They cannot find such knowledge. Strong Gu then says there has only been strong and weak, never right or wrong, so the classification is in vain.",
        "chapters": [
          2176
        ],
